格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 会话修改审查插件：追踪会话内 write/edit，diff 对比展示，会话隔离/子代理聚合/SSE 实时推送/颜色自定义","id":"gh:1335100960","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-change-review","slug":"cirelir/dsh-change-review","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 会话修改审查插件：追踪会话内 write/edit，diff 对比展示，会话隔离/子代理聚合/SSE 实时推送/颜色自定义"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-change-review"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A **session change-review plugin** for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): automatically tracks file `write`/`ed"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"it` operations inside your session and renders them as line-level diffs with customizable colors — s"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ession-isolated, subagent-aggregated, and pushed live via SSE."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> One package carries both the Host logic and the browser UI (`dsh.bundle` + `dsh.client` manifests)"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" One package carries both the Host logic and the browser UI (`dsh.bundle` + `dsh.client` manifests)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文说明"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Feature | Description |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Auto tracking | Listens to `write` / `edit` tool calls, records before/after content and timestamp"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"s |\n| Diff view | LCS line-level diff: added (green) / removed (red) / context (gray) lines with bot"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"h-side line numbers |\n| Session isolation | Each session reviews only its own changes; switching ses"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"sions switches the review |\n| Subagent aggregation | Changes made by subagents are aggregated into t"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"he root parent session |\n| Live updates | SSE server push — the badge and list refresh instantly whe"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"n files change (zero polling) |\n| Revert changes | Undo ONE specific change (later non-overlapping c"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"hanges are kept) or the WHOLE file (restore the pre-session snapshot; a file created in-session is d"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"eleted) — writes directly to disk |\n| Per-turn review | Each turn's tail shows a card with THIS turn"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"'s changed files and expandable diffs (with per-op revert), distinct from the session-wide 「审查」tab |"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"\n| Count badge | The 「审查」(Review) tab shows the pending file count; badge background/text colors are"},{"id":"p8s11","text":" customizable |\n| Color customization | 12 colors configurable under **Settings → 修改审查** (Review), i"},{"id":"p8s12","text":"ncluding the turn-tail card's background, border, and added/removed counts (different defaults); eve"},{"id":"p8s13","text":"ry color has an opacity slider (rgba), persisted in localStorage |\n| Clean sidebar | Hides the Cordi"},{"id":"p8s14","text":"s plugin run indicator (`cordis-panel`) from the left sidebar |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 📸 Screenshots"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Review tab — file list + diff preview | Per-turn review card |\n|:---:|:---:|"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Expanded diff with per-change revert | Color customization (Settings → 修改审查) |\n|:---:|:---:|"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Installed from the plugin market |\n|:---:|"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 📦 Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Option A: `dsh plugin add` (after npm publish)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Option B: manual deployment"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Make the package resolvable by the harness (e.g. place it in `node_modules`) and register it in t"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"he profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"2. Restart dsh web"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> This plugin targets the Web profile (`dsh --profile web`)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## 🚀 Usage"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"1. Open a session and click the **「审查」(Review)** view tab (after「对话」Chat, before「轨迹」Trajectory)\n2. L"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"eft: file list (write/edit counts, ~added/~removed stats); right: the selected file's diff. The two "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"panes **scroll independently** (scrolling the file list never scrolls the diff preview and vice vers"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"a), so you can browse files while keeping the preview in place. The header toggle switches the scope"},{"id":"p22s5","text":": **此会话** (all session changes) or **最新一轮** (the latest turn's changes)\n3. The badge increments **in"},{"id":"p22s6","text":" real time** when files change; top bar: **↻** refresh, **清空** clear the current session's records\n4"},{"id":"p22s7","text":". **Revert** (each action asks for confirmation, then writes the file on disk directly):\n- **One cha"},{"id":"p22s8","text":"nge**: the **撤回此项** (revert this) button on each edit/write section header — restores the file to th"},{"id":"p22s9","text":"at change's previous content, keeping later changes that do not overlap (overlapping ones are reject"},{"id":"p22s10","text":"ed with a hint)\n- **Whole file**: the **撤回全部修改** (revert all) button at the top of the detail pane —"},{"id":"p22s11","text":" restores the file to its state before this session's first recorded change; a file created in this "},{"id":"p22s12","text":"session is deleted\n5. **Per-turn review**: after each turn, a **本轮变更审查** card appears at the turn's "},{"id":"p22s13","text":"tail listing the files changed in that turn (write/edit counts, ~added/~removed); click a file to ex"},{"id":"p22s14","text":"pand its diffs and revert a single change. Session-cumulative changes stay in the 「审查」tab — the two "},{"id":"p22s15","text":"views are independent\n6. Colors: **Settings → 修改审查** (8 items + light/dark presets + restore default"},{"id":"p22s16","text":"s), auto-saved, survives refresh"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 🎨 Color Configuration"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Item | Key | Light default | Dark preset |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Added line background | `addBg` | `#e6ffec` | `#10251c` |\n| Added line text | `addFg` | `#1a7f37` "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"| `#7ee787` |\n| Removed line background | `delBg` | `#ffebe9` | `#2d1415` |\n| Removed line text | `d"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"elFg` | `#cf222e` | `#ffa198` |\n| Context background | `ctxBg` | `#f6f8fa` | `#161b22` |\n| Line numb"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"ers / markers | `gutter` | `#57606a` | `#8b949e` |\n| Badge background | `badgeBg` | `#0969da` | `#44"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"93f8` |\n| Badge text | `badgeFg` | `#ffffff` | `#0d1117` |\n| Added count (turn-tail list) | `turnAdd"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"` | `#1a7f37` | `#7ee787` |\n| Removed count (turn-tail list) | `turnDel` | `#cf222e` | `#ffa198` |\n|"},{"id":"p25s7","text":" Card background (turn-tail) | `turnBg` | `rgba(255,183,77,.1)` (light orange 10%) | `rgba(255,183,7"},{"id":"p25s8","text":"7,.1)` (light orange 10%) |\n| Card border (turn-tail) | `turnBorder` | `#ffb74d` (light orange) | `#"},{"id":"p25s9","text":"ffb74d` (light orange) |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## 🧠 Behavior Notes"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- **Scope**: all `write`/`edit` tool calls in the current process, bucketed per session; subagent ch"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"anges are aggregated up the owner chain to the root parent session\n- **Real time**: the Host pushes "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"via SSE (`/diff-review/events`); the client only processes events for the current session\n- **Persis"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"tence**: colors persist (localStorage key `dsh.diff-review.colors`); review records persist to disk "},{"id":"p27s5","text":"(`~/.dsh/profiles/web/diff-review-state.json`, debounced auto-save + sync flush on exit) and are res"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"tored automatically after a dsh web restart — delete that file to wipe all history\n- **Capacity guar"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"ds**: max 100 ops per file; content truncated at 120KB per op; diff capped at 1500 lines per side; t"},{"id":"p27s8","text":"he 3-way merge used for single-change revert is capped at 2000 lines per side\n- **Revert internals**"},{"id":"p27s9","text":": each op records the full before/after content snapshot reported by the write/edit tool. Reverting "},{"id":"p27s10","text":"the last op restores the exact snapshot; reverting a middle op performs a 3-way line merge (keeps la"},{"id":"p27s11","text":"ter changes, removes that op) and refuses on overlap; after a successful revert the op and everythin"},{"id":"p27s12","text":"g after it leave the pending list\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## 🗂 Architecture"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
